ction) can increase the risk of default by an issuer or counterparty, which can affect a security's or instrument's value or result in delays in recovering securities and/or capital from a counterparty."],["TradingIssuesMember","Trading Issues. There can be no assurance that an active trading market will be maintained. Market makers and Authorized Participants are not obligated to make a market in the fund's shares or to submit purchase and redemption orders for creation units. Decisions by market makers or Authorized Participants to reduce their role with respect to market making or creation and redemption activities during times of market stress, or a decline in the number of Authorized Participants due to decisions to exit the business, bankruptcy, or other factors, could inhibit the effectiveness of the arbitrage …"]],"risk_narrative":null},"ncen":{"series":"S000102552","name":"Fidelity Enhanced Small Cap Growth ETF","lei":"254900C3SS1FETNN5676","acc":"0000035402-26-005676","filed":"2026-09-11","period":"2026-06-30","cik":945908,"index":false,"index_affiliated":false,"index_exclusive":false,"multi_inverse":false,"fund_of_funds":false,"non_diversified":false,"track_diff_gross":null,"track_diff":null,"track_err_gross":null,"track_err":null,"lends":false,"lending_ok":true,"avg_on_loan":0.0,"lending_income":0.0,"expense_cap":true,"fees_waived":false,"commissions":1130.93,"principal_trades":0.0,"avg_net_assets":5298972.0,"mgmt_fee":null,"net_expenses":null,"price":null,"nav":null,"derivatives_rule":true,"line_of_credit":true,"registrant":{"name":"Fidelity Covington Trust","file_num":"811-07319","lei":"549300JFYFTF85QAQR28","family":"Fidelity Group of Funds","type":"N-1A","state":"US-MA","material_weakness":false,"accountant_changed":false,"legal_proceeding":false},"accountant":["Deloitte & Touche LLP","PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP"],"distributor":[["Fidelity Distributors Company LLC",true]],"board":[["Oscar Munoz",false],["Karen Peetz",false],["Robert A Lawrence",true]